    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/82dd21cc460419c5e0cd386307e9b8e4.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Wings of Seduction&quot;</strong>is a clothing damage shoot-em-up featuring roguelike gameplay. You play as the captain of an elite squad of hotties, utilizing a variety of unique weapons to complete dangerous missions. Choose from a selection of skills and weapon mods to create your own unique gear and defeat\u2026 the FINAL BOSS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/ae190afa95eb130780fe5cd3b27a4371.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/928ac2d041e1df6cfec2c0599ad7e885.poster.avif?t=1750869127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/928ac2d041e1df6cfec2c0599ad7e885.webm?t=1750869127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Make the gameplay yours. Weapons come with various upgrade branches, each with its own distinct qualities and stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/50b99eccab818fbb4e7d3290f776c2c4.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/a868c897fd35a40981992923e22ecae3.poster.avif?t=1750869127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/a868c897fd35a40981992923e22ecae3.webm?t=1750869127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/a868c897fd35a40981992923e22ecae3.mp4?t=1750869127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/87d1a99c6c58ca57ea5c25ff8f1b21be.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/6d6e6bb77a6575d94513615c96af1688.poster.avif?t=1750869127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/6d6e6bb77a6575d94513615c96af1688.webm?t=1750869127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Destroy that babe\u2019s clothes for titillating rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/5edc7d9f57d98d06208759af875861f9.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/df6a62946e0141ff590f578ca19cd628.poster.avif?t=1750869127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/df6a62946e0141ff590f578ca19cd628.webm?t=1750869127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>With over 30 modifications to choose from, create gear that ain\u2019t no one else got!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want spliting bullets that chase enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want your kills to trigger a blast?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find it here!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/d642c28fe98e4480579086ffac3a7a72.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/a621026d840267737b2af1cfa4a7a905.poster.avif?t=1750869127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/a621026d840267737b2af1cfa4a7a905.webm?t=1750869127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Over 50 upgrades allows for multitude of unique tactics and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/e39ea0618121b88b97a3ebbeb7710f1f.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/f97659270c42bdb8ba2dc07766b63420.avif?t=1750869127\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows you to switch to a cat form or full mask mode at any time, ensuring you can play comfortably whenever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/e07d03675162b7fce8622b0bf5d74c65.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/7c8c224c79a64c23af9de2681aade702.avif?t=1750869127\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/82dd21cc460419c5e0cd386307e9b8e4.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Wings of Seduction&quot;</strong>is a clothing damage shoot-em-up featuring roguelike gameplay. You play as the captain of an elite squad of hotties, utilizing a variety of unique weapons to complete dangerous missions. Choose from a selection of skills and weapon mods to create your own unique gear and defeat\u2026 the FINAL BOSS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/ae190afa95eb130780fe5cd3b27a4371.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/928ac2d041e1df6cfec2c0599ad7e885.poster.avif?t=1750869127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/928ac2d041e1df6cfec2c0599ad7e885.webm?t=1750869127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Make the gameplay yours. Weapons come with various upgrade branches, each with its own distinct qualities and stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/50b99eccab818fbb4e7d3290f776c2c4.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/a868c897fd3