oose from, create gear that ain\u2019t no one else got!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want spliting bullets that chase enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want your kills to trigger a blast?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find it here!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/d642c28fe98e4480579086ffac3a7a72.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/a621026d840267737b2af1cfa4a7a905.poster.avif?t=1750869127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/a621026d840267737b2af1cfa4a7a905.webm?t=1750869127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Over 50 upgrades allows for multitude of unique tactics and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/e39ea0618121b88b97a3ebbeb7710f1f.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/f97659270c42bdb8ba2dc07766b63420.avif?t=1750869127\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows you to switch to a cat form or full mask mode at any time, ensuring you can play comfortably whenever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/e07d03675162b7fce8622b0bf5d74c65.webp?t=1750869127\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455140/extras/7c8c224c79a64c23af9de2681aade702.avif?t=1750869127\" /></span></p>",
